 "emoji": "🔭",
 "sentences": [
  "Voyager 1 reaches one light-day away!",
  "It takes light 24 hours to reach the spacecraft.",
  "Catch Southern Taurids on November 5 and Northern Taurids on November 12.",
  "Spot Mars and Jupiter close together before sunrise on November 15 and 16.",
  "Watch the Leonids peak with up to 15 meteors per hour on November 17 and 18.",
  "End the month by seeing the first of three consecutive supermoons on November 24."
